<title>SPAIN: Spain's Berberana buys Argentina winery Martins.</title>
<headline>Spain's Berberana buys Argentina winery Martins.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish winery Bodegas Berberana's bought Argentina's Bodegas Martins for $2 million, a statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Berberana group had total sales of around 14.8 billion pesetas in 1996, up 58 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>Berberana said it expected to reach total sales of around 10 million dollars in its first year of activity with its new Argentine buy.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
